.TH OCODE 1 "2026-09-30" "ocode 1.0.0rc1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ocode \- smart, Odoo-aware code editor for the terminal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ocode
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIpath\fR]
.br
.B ocode doctor
[\fBkeys\fR]
.br
.B ocode index
.br
.B ocode init
[\fIpath\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ocode
is a terminal (Textual TUI) editor for Odoo developers: editing, module
navigation, server run/update/logs/shell, static Odoo intelligence and
boilerplate generators, over SSH or on headless servers.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR path
File or folder to open. \fBfile:line:col\fR jumps to a position.
.TP
.BR \-\-conf " " \fIFILE\fR
Odoo config file override.
.TP
.BR \-\-odoo\-bin " " \fIFILE\fR
Path to \fBodoo-bin\fR override.
.TP
.BR \-\-db " " \fINAME\fR
Database name override.
.TP
.BR \-\-no\-index
Disable background indexing.
.TP
.BR \-\-log\-level " " \fILEVEL\fR
Log level (default INFO).
.TP
.BR \-\-config\-dir " " \fIDIR\fR
Override config directory.
.TP
.BR \-\-ascii
ASCII icons (no Nerd-Font glyphs).
.TP
.BR \-\-version
Print version and exit.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B doctor
Environment and project diagnostics. \fBdoctor keys\fR reports which key
combinations the current terminal delivers.
.TP
.B index
Rebuild the Odoo knowledge index (SQLite cache, safe to delete).
.TP
.B init
Write \fB.ocode/config.toml\fR and \fB.ocode/servers.toml\fR stubs.
.SH KEYS
F1 help screen lists all bindings. Essentials: Ctrl+P quick open,
Alt+M related file, F5/F6 server restart/start-stop, Ctrl+F5 update module,
Ctrl+` shell, Ctrl+Shift+N generate, F8 lint, Ctrl+. quick fix, Ctrl+Q quit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/ocode/config.toml
User configuration.
.TP
.I <workspace>/.ocode/servers.toml
Server profiles.
.TP
.I ~/.config/ocode/templates/*.j2
User template overrides.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/ocode/index/
Knowledge index cache (safe to delete).
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/ocode/
Sessions, swap files, shell history, logs.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR odoo-bin (1),
.BR rg (1),
.BR pylint (1)
